			"notes": "Nightly build of port/minecraft-26.3. Diagnostic build for hardware RT not rendering.\n\nnightly-2026-11-09-4 showed that the RT shader still sees every descriptor as empty, with the Streamline hook both on and off. So Streamline is not the cause.\n\n- Each of the 16 single-binding probes now records what its one descriptor shows: image width, buffer length, the first value of the frame data, and the TLAS. The new log line is `RT descriptors pushed one at a time, as a probe sees them: …`.\n\nNot tested in game. Please send latest.log again after about 10 seconds in a world. The Streamline hook can be on or off."
